      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a production set in the Bronx around 1975. We're trying to get the casting right for the background extras to make sure the atmosphere feels real. Can you describe what the typical 'street-level' inhabitants of the Bronx would have looked like back then? Like, the types of people you'd just see hanging out on the corners or walking the blocks? We want to build some authentic character archetypes for the crowd scenes.",
