    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's helpful, especially the bit about the posture and the worn-out look. To get even more specific for the casting calls, could you drill down into the different \"types\" we might see in those projects? Like, when we're looking at the different groups living there—the Black and Latino communities specifically—what are some of the distinct ways they would have expressed their identity or \"street\" presence in the mid-70s? We want to make sure we aren't just making everyone look the same, but rather capturing the specific cultural vibes of those different groups.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
